    "title": "SF Bay Area Coda Calibration Example Dataset for CCT",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10019686",
    "publication_date": "2023-10-18",
    "description": "<p>The following is an example dataset specific for the Coda Calibration Tool (CCT) that is focused on the San Francisco Bay Area region using a small-to-moderate magnitude earthquake dataset spanning local-to-regional distances using open data from the UC Berkeley Seismological Laboratory (BSL):&nbsp; &nbsp;https://github.com/LLNL/coda-calibration-tool/releases/</p><p>The CCT tool description can be found here:&nbsp; &nbsp;https://software.llnl.gov/coda-calibration-tool/</p><p>(updated Oct. 18, 2023)</p>",
